#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:5
#: 315b8dcc2bf940079ffcd5347426f3f1 6a6ba7ce3b0f46a1a5df2f85d71e2de8
msgid "Preventing Ground Oscillation"
msgstr "防止地面共振"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:7
#: 65342ab41fd5437889b8e26284c9f554 dd50bcd248324d75b2afabe9f195b6d4
msgid ""
"Often a perfectly tuned aircraft will have a tendency to shake of oscillate "
"when landed or just before takeoff. This phenomenon is known as ground "
"resonance oscillation and is caused by the attitude controller interacting "
"with a flexible frame or flexible landing gear. Ardupilot allows you to "
"reduce the gain of the attitude controllers in the roll, pitch and yaw axis "
"to attenuate the PID loops while landed to remove this instability. This "
"should be done with care as we do not want to compromise our roll and pitch "
"attitude control performance as we takeoff any more than is absolutely "
"necessary. We can be less conservative in the yaw axis as compromised yaw "
"control in the first half second after takeoff does not pose a great risk."
msgstr ""
"调参良好的飞行器在降落或起飞前往往会有抖动或震荡的倾向。这种现象称为地面共振震荡，由姿态控制器与柔性机架或柔性起落架相互作用引起。ArduPilot "
"允许在降落状态下降低横滚、俯仰和偏航轴的姿态控制器增益，以衰减 PID "
"环路并消除这种不稳定性。操作时需谨慎，因为我们不希望在起飞过程中对横滚和俯仰姿态控制性能造成不必要的影响。偏航轴可以相对宽松，因为起飞后半秒内偏航控制能力下降风险较低。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:9
#: 326e6078fd8e4468a42634ba32475d8a a1d909519d5c4d2ca4200b7586545e49
msgid ""
"The three parameters used to address ground resonance oscillation are "
":ref:`ATC_LAND_R_MULT<ATC_LAND_R_MULT>`, "
":ref:`ATC_LAND_P_MULT<ATC_LAND_P_MULT>`, and "
":ref:`ATC_LAND_Y_MULT<ATC_LAND_Y_MULT>`, which provide the ability to reduce"
" the Rll,Pitch, and Yaw pid gains on the ground."
msgstr ""
"用于解决地面共振震荡的三个参数为 "
":ref:`ATC_LAND_R_MULT<ATC_LAND_R_MULT>`、:ref:`ATC_LAND_P_MULT<ATC_LAND_P_MULT>`"
" 和 :ref:`ATC_LAND_Y_MULT<ATC_LAND_Y_MULT>`，它们可在地面时分别降低横滚、俯仰和偏航的 PID 增益。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:12
#: 130de009710044e4abdd8ddf6c7358aa 6ba55060a0c64e1d82c7a182bb6cacab
msgid "Evaluating Ground Resonance Oscillation"
msgstr "评估地面共振震荡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:14
#: a6550ada233440f7b064867c43db5d26 efeafb9c97834f93aaafa9e742b40f43
msgid "Arm the throttle in Stabilize Mode"
msgstr "在 Stabilize 模式下解锁油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:15
#: 6a2102d77a044dba84454cd35cb64fc7 dea1b74f67c3408882136a390cfe909c
msgid ""
"Lift the throttle to the point where the motors increase to MOT_SPIN_MIN"
msgstr "将油门提升至电机转速达到 MOT_SPIN_MIN 的位置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:16
#: bf0f640ee6d54af49ad7cbeff3a372c3 d58ee9adce8c4cc2a74bfce63797d8ad
msgid "Observe the axis off oscillation,"
msgstr "观察各轴震荡情况，"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:17
#: 401c540f406a4799a099a14564a5c7d8 d154fec27e614b839e757e682760d3ac
msgid "Back off :ref:`ATC_LAND_Y_MULT<ATC_LAND_Y_MULT>` to 0.5"
msgstr "将 :ref:`ATC_LAND_Y_MULT<ATC_LAND_Y_MULT>` 调低至 0.5"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:18
#: 407aef12fd8a4428b4cc3e5c01e30c1a d435a02d6d184b8496220df474baa34c
msgid "Revaluate Roll and Pitch oscillation for improvement"
msgstr "重新评估横滚和俯仰震荡是否有所改善"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:19
#: 1a6e6c168aa34ba7a61e2a84b46c64ed 75dac229cbe94df0b2ce6fa72572de06
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Back off axis where oscillation is observed in 25% steps until oscillation "
"is manageable."
msgstr "对观察到震荡的轴，以 25% 为步长逐步调低，直至震荡可控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-ground-resonance.rst:21
#: 05403a991298465bbfe67b32ec250c09 eb495b56c5f74a1589799c75184709bd
msgid ""
"Extreme care should be taken if :ref:`ATC_LAND_R_MULT<ATC_LAND_R_MULT>` or "
":ref:`ATC_LAND_P_MULT<ATC_LAND_P_MULT>` is reduced below 0.5."
msgstr ""
"如需将 :ref:`ATC_LAND_R_MULT<ATC_LAND_R_MULT>` 或 "
":ref:`ATC_LAND_P_MULT<ATC_LAND_P_MULT>` 降低至 0.5 以下，请格外谨慎。"
